XLibre X server
===============

url    = https://github.com/X11Libre/xserver.git
tag    = xlibre-xserver-25.1.11
commit = ec1f2d37daa1450d8452abb547de4546321d7bb9
date   = 2026-10-31

Built by tools/desktop/build-xlibre.sh, which foxyn-desktop(8) runs on
the desktop image (tools/linux/build.sh desktop): it downloads this
revision's archive, checks its SHA-256 and installs in
/System/Library/XLibre (docs/desktop-xlibre.md). It is not part of
buildworld. Keep build output outside the submodule. When upgrading,
update the revision and checksum in build-xlibre.sh too.

License: mixed source notices; see COPYING and individual files. Complete file-level and asset provenance review and preserve
applicable notices and source obligations before distribution.

When upgrading, review dependencies, API and ABI compatibility, FoxynBSD
portability, license notices and the full desktop build and runtime tests.
